"Overview" = "概述";
"Palimpsest is designed as a private vault that keeps your sensitive files under your control." = "Palimpsest 被设计为一个私密保险箱，让你的敏感文件始终由你自己控制。";
"Data We Store" = "我们保存的数据";
"The app stores vault files, thumbnails, encrypted metadata, folders, import records, sync status, and local security settings needed to operate the vault." = "App 会保存保险箱文件、缩略图、加密元数据、文件夹、导入记录、同步状态，以及运行保险箱所需的本地安全设置。";
"Gesture templates and recovery information are stored on this device using local protected storage. They are not sent to an app server." = "轨迹模板和恢复信息会使用本机受保护存储保存，不会发送到 App 服务器。";
"iCloud Sync" = "iCloud 同步";
"When iCloud sync is available, encrypted vault data may be copied to your private iCloud container so your own devices can recover or download it." = "当 iCloud 同步可用时，加密后的保险箱数据可能会复制到你的私人 iCloud 容器，方便你自己的设备恢复或下载。";
"iCloud availability, account access, and storage behavior are controlled by Apple and your iCloud account settings." = "iCloud 可用性、账户访问和存储行为由 Apple 及你的 iCloud 账户设置控制。";
"Sharing and Export" = "分享与导出";
"When you export or share an item, iOS may hand the selected file to the destination app or system service you choose." = "当你导出或分享项目时，iOS 可能会把所选文件交给你选择的目标 App 或系统服务。";
"Your Control" = "你的控制权";
"You can delete vault items, manage permissions in iPhone Settings, and choose whether to use iCloud features." = "你可以删除保险箱项目、在 iPhone 设置中管理权限，并自行选择是否使用 iCloud 功能。";
"Deleting an item from the vault removes the app's local record and attempts to remove the matching encrypted cloud copy when sync is active." = "从保险箱删除项目会移除 App 的本地记录；当同步启用时，也会尝试删除对应的云端加密副本。";
"Permissions used by this app" = "本 App 使用的权限";
"How Permissions Work" = "权限如何工作";
"Palimpsest asks for a permission only when a feature needs it. You can change most permissions later in iPhone Settings." = "Palimpsest 只会在功能需要时请求权限。大多数权限之后都可以在 iPhone 设置中修改。";
"Denying a permission may disable the related feature, but the rest of the vault continues to work locally." = "拒绝某项权限可能会导致对应功能不可用，但保险箱的其他本地功能仍可继续使用。";
"Used as the first unlock layer before your private gesture can open the encrypted vault." = "作为第一层解锁验证使用，通过后你的私密轨迹才能打开加密保险箱。";
"Manage Permissions" = "管理权限";
"Open iPhone Settings to review or change camera, photo, location, and notification-style system permissions for this app." = "打开 iPhone 设置，可查看或修改本 App 的相机、照片、位置以及通知类系统权限。";
"Require Face ID" = "需要 Face ID";
"When enabled, opening the real vault requires Face ID first, then your gesture. When disabled, only the gesture is required." = "开启后，打开真实保险箱需要先通过 Face ID，再绘制轨迹。关闭后，只需要轨迹解锁。";
"Unlock Grace Period" = "免重复验证时长";
"Skip repeated Face ID and gesture checks after returning from the background" = "从后台回到 App 后，跳过重复的 Face ID 和轨迹验证";
"Always require unlock" = "每次都重新验证";
"5 minutes" = "5 分钟";
"10 minutes" = "10 分钟";
"15 minutes" = "15 分钟";
"30 minutes" = "30 分钟";
"60 minutes" = "60 分钟";
"Lock every time the app goes to the background." = "每次 App 进入后台都立即锁定。";
"Do not ask for Face ID or gesture again within %d minutes after a successful unlock." = "成功解锁后 %d 分钟内不再要求 Face ID 或轨迹验证。";
"When enabled, Palimpsest remembers a successful unlock for the selected time after the app enters the background. Closing or relaunching the app still starts locked." = "开启后，Palimpsest 会在 App 进入后台后按所选时长记住本次成功解锁。彻底关闭或重新启动 App 时仍会从锁定状态开始。";
"Membership required after setup" = "设置完成后需要开通会员";
"After the security setup is complete, start the 7-day trial or choose a monthly, yearly, or lifetime plan before using the vault. You can cancel subscriptions anytime in your Apple ID settings." = "安全设置完成后，需要先开始 7 天试用，或选择月度、年度、买断方案，才可以使用保险箱。订阅可随时在 Apple ID 设置中取消。";
"Start membership to use Palimpsest" = "开通会员后使用 Palimpsest";
"Your private vault is ready. Start the 7-day trial or activate a paid plan to continue into the app. Without an active membership, the vault stays locked." = "你的私密保险箱已经准备好。请开始 7 天试用或开通付费方案后继续进入 App。没有有效会员时，保险箱会保持锁定。";
"Membership is required to use Palimpsest. Monthly and yearly plans can start with a 7-day free trial, and the lifetime plan is a one-time purchase for current Pro vault features." = "使用 Palimpsest 需要开通会员。月度和年度方案可从 7 天免费试用开始，买断方案为一次购买，解锁当前 Pro 保险箱功能。";
"7-day trial" = "7 天试用";
